msgstr "Mit dem Browser anmelden"

# machine-translated
#: data/ui/login.blp:141
msgid ""
"Sign in on TIDAL. Your browser then shows a “Page not found” page; that's "
"expected. Copy its full address from the address bar and paste it below."
